CONJURE

Available to all classes.
One persistent companion per character.
Cooldown: 300 seconds.

Level 1:  conjure wolf
Level 10: conjure scorpion
Level 20: conjure fire
Level 30: conjure minotaur
Level 40: conjure wraith
Level 60: conjure dragon

Companions automatically assist in ordinary combat.

Species abilities:
  Spectral Wolf: physical attacks.
  Venom Scorpion: 10 percent venom activation.
  Fire Elemental: 15 percent double damage.
  Minotaur Guardian: 10 percent attack delay.
  Shadow Wraith: 20 percent mana drain.
  Ancient Dragon: 15 percent triple damage.

